'''Saint Red Fox''' is the sixth and final stage in [[Dead End Night]]. [[Li'l Nyandam (Enemy)|Li'l Nyandam]] resides within this stage and can be unlocked as a [[Li'l Nyandam (Special Cat)|Cat Unit]] at a 30% chance (guaranteed when using a Treasure Radar) whereas the [[The Battle Cats Unite!|Nintendo Switch]] port has a guaranteed drop when beating the stage.

